## Critical Dependency Overrides

**Root `package.json` overrides** (must be respected):

```json
{
  "apollo-upload-client": "17.0.0",
  "fs-capacitor": "6.2.0",
  "multer": "1.4.5-lts.1",        // ⚠️ Don't upgrade
  "express": "4.19.2",            // ⚠️ Don't upgrade
  "dayjs": "^1.11.3",
  "axios": "1.6.8",               // ⚠️ Don't upgrade
  "lodash": "4.17.21",
  "rxjs": "^7.8.1"
}
```

**Why**: These overrides exist for compatibility/security. Don't upgrade without thorough testing.

